Country flags: the official flag images on Wikimedia Commons ("Flag of <country>.svg",
Bolivia: "Flag of Bolivia (state).svg"), retrieved 2026-11-02 from
https://commons.wikimedia.org/. National flags are in the public domain in nearly all
cases; the file page of each image on Commons states its licence and authors. Flag
images are used as published, without changes.

Added 2026-11-11 (same source and terms): Bangladesh, Guyana, Pakistan, Paraguay, Suriname, Tunisia, Vietnam.
Added 2026-11-13 (same source and terms): Senegal.
